WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.260
If you were looking to get your heart melted today,

2
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.260
well, we've got you covered.

3
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:08.050
Fox News reports a second grade class

4
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.430
at St. Michael's School in Richmond, Virginia,

5
00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:14.420
is learning about persuasive writing.

6
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:18.870
And to practice, they're writing adopt me letters

7
00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:22.340
for local dogs at the shelter.

8
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.760 line:15%
Each student was assigned a dog

9
00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:27.130 line:15%
and then briefed on their personality.

10
00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:29.630 line:15%
And then they wrote letters from the dogs

11
00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.610 line:15%
asking to be adopted.

12
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:33.530 line:15%
Here's a sample.

13
00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:37.470
Hello, I'm Potato Chip, I'm a Pit Bull.

14
00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.590
I won't hurt you, I'll give you lots of kisses, slurp.

15
00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:43.760
I like the animal shelter, but I wanna live with you.

16
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:44.593
Oh, come on.

17
00:00:44.593 --> 00:00:48.790
They wrote letters for 24 dogs and one cat,

18
00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:53.043
and so far, now eight pets have found their forever home.

19
00:00:53.905 --> 00:00:56.310
(audience applauds)

20
00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:57.260
This one gets me.

21
00:00:58.757 --> 00:00:59.590
I know.

22
00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:04.040
I mean, is this not like a potential new model too,

23
00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.500
because we're looking,

24
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.871
you know, I'm a huge advocate for animal rescue.

25
00:01:09.871 --> 00:01:10.810
Me too.

26
00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:13.420
And this would be such a game changer,

27
00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.100
it's such a heartbreaking process,

28
00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:18.690
and kids get to learn empathy and writing skills,

29
00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:21.700
and the customers who are out there searching

30
00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:23.320
get a little sense of the animals.

31
00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.410
It could really change the whole experience.

32
00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:27.300
I mean, eight adoptions,

33
00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.200
like you could double the game here.

34
00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:30.033
You're so right.

35
00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:32.930
This is a model that should be in schools across the country

36
00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:34.900
because it teaches not only the writing skills,

37
00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:36.530
but empathy, cause and effect,

38
00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:37.700
how you can make a difference.

39
00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.859
These little kids are doing this, it's incredible.

40
00:01:39.859 --> 00:01:40.692
(audience cheers)
(audience applauds)

41
00:01:40.692 --> 00:01:42.164
I even...

42
00:01:42.164 --> 00:01:44.810
And it helps with when you're adopting

43
00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:47.830
to get a little insight into that animal.

44
00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:50.290
Yeah, you know, my Wellington is in charge

45
00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:52.820
of curriculum at a school, a district in Long Island.

46
00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:53.761
I sent this to him.

47
00:01:53.761 --> 00:01:55.610
I'm like, now I don't tell you what to do,

48
00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:57.550
'cause you know what you're doing, but you gotta do this,

49
00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.030
'cause this is so,

50
00:01:59.030 --> 00:02:00.260
it just moved me so much.

51
00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:01.500
It moves me so much.

52
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.870
Well, let's see what he does with this

53
00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:05.830
and maybe a suggestion, if anybody wants to take it,

54
00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.129
just keep this going, it's so wonderful.

55
00:02:08.129 --> 00:02:09.020
Yes, please.

56
00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.870
Thank you for doing that, you're an example to us all.

57
00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.477 line:15%
Let's keep this going.

58
00:02:14.477 --> 00:02:17.644 line:15%
(upbeat bright music)

